(7273283, 1131557, 13077, '<td valign="top">Excellent timing and great scene with good light, wonderful eye contact, just enough motion softness and grittiness and good processing.<br/>And the phantom pair of legs growing from the side of her hip is fascinating.</td>', 'Excellent timing and great scene with good light, wonderful eye contact, just enough motion softness and grittiness and good processing.And the phantom pair of legs growing from the side of her hip is fascinating.', '2014-10-13 19:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
