(7273289, 1131698, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nice scene, well exposed and composed. I feel like as a candid photo it might have been stronger if the people had played a more prominent role in the photo, though.</td>', 'Nice scene, well exposed and composed. I feel like as a candid photo it might have been stronger if the people had played a more prominent role in the photo, though.', '2014-10-13 19:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
