(7273292, 1132078, 13077, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I like the motion blur and the fast-paced, dangerous environment it shows, and although the man in the wheelchair takes up a small amount of the frame you''ve made it clear that he is the center of this photo''s universe and everything else provides support and contrast. One of my favorites so far.</td>', 'Very nice. I like the motion blur and the fast-paced, dangerous environment it shows, and although the man in the wheelchair takes up a small amount of the frame you''ve made it clear that he is the center of this photo''s universe and everything else provides support and contrast. One of my favorites so far.', '2014-10-13 19:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7273293, 1131896, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed and processed - old fashioned style, and works well here.</td>', 'Nicely composed and processed - old fashioned style, and works well here.', '2014-10-13 19:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
