(7274183, 1132065, 134859, '<td valign="top">I absolutely LOVE this photo!  <br/>The smiles on their faces are priceless!  It''s a true candid moment indeed!<br/>Very nice processing.  Lovely detail.  <br/>Overall, wonderfully done!  <br/> <br/>(Commenting Only)</td>', 'I absolutely LOVE this photo!  The smiles on their faces are priceless!  It''s a true candid moment indeed!Very nice processing.  Lovely detail.  Overall, wonderfully done!   (Commenting Only)', '2014-10-16 12:43:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274211, 1131816, 153814, '<td valign="top">In a single image you were able to take a once proud people and reduce them to looking like carny folk  panhandling at a flea market.<br/>I like the colors and under the harsh lighting conditions the image came out pretty good, but overall I find the image rather depressing.<br/>I have to bump this up a bit because you did evoke an emotion and thats what its all about.<br/></td>', 'In a single image you were able to take a once proud people and reduce them to looking like carny folk  panhandling at a flea market.I like the colors and under the harsh lighting conditions the image came out pretty good, but overall I find the image rather depressing.I have to bump this up a bit because you did evoke an emotion and thats what its all about.', '2014-10-16 14:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
