(7274542, 1131816, 54446, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by nygold:</b></div><hr/><i> In a single image you were able to take a once proud people and reduce them to looking like carny folk  panhandling at a flea market.<br/>I like the colors and under the harsh lighting conditions the image came out pretty good, but overall I find the image rather depressing.<br/>I have to bump this up a bit because you did evoke an emotion and thats what its all about. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>This challenge was supposed to be a candid shot.  You don''t understand the circumstances and you are out of line to criticize this situation.  Also, it was taken at high elevation, so the light is often harsh because there is little pollution and humidity to diffuse light.</td>', 'Originally posted by nygold: In a single image you were able to take a once proud people and reduce them to looking like carny folk  panhandling at a flea market.I like the colors and under the harsh lighting conditions the image came out pretty good, but overall I find the image rather depressing.I have to bump this up a bit because you did evoke an emotion and thats what its all about.  This challenge was supposed to be a candid shot.  You don''t understand the circumstances and you are out of line to criticize this situation.  Also, it was taken at high elevation, so the light is often harsh because there is little pollution and humidity to diffuse light.', '2014-10-17 01:14:13.000000', NULL, 0),
