(7274615, 1131585, 38032, '<td valign="top">You''ve sort of captured all of humanity here somehow. He''s old. He''s young. He appreciates life but knows its potential misery. His art is great but he doesn''t boast - it''s just what he does - like breathing and feeling. Just great.</td>', 'You''ve sort of captured all of humanity here somehow. He''s old. He''s young. He appreciates life but knows its potential misery. His art is great but he doesn''t boast - it''s just what he does - like breathing and feeling. Just great.', '2014-10-17 09:33:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(7274618, 1131897, 176839, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Tiny:</b></div><hr/><i> so this is a set up ? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Tiny yes mate it is, it is meant to show that this happens in real life, but it''s a bit insensitive to be right in there photographing someone being spoon fed while he has tears running down his face. Most of my work is very confronting,  my wife won''t let me put it up here on challenges,  because sometimes they are  bit too in your face type of photos. But that''s what interests me, issues we face in real life told through the photographers POV.</td>', 'Originally posted by Tiny: so this is a set up ?   Tiny yes mate it is, it is meant to show that this happens in real life, but it''s a bit insensitive to be right in there photographing someone being spoon fed while he has tears running down his face. Most of my work is very confronting,  my wife won''t let me put it up here on challenges,  because sometimes they are  bit too in your face type of photos. But that''s what interests me, issues we face in real life told through the photographers POV.', '2014-10-17 09:50:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(7274620, 1132098, 176839, '<td valign="top">Wow you are wayyy ahead of you age mate, very mature photographer,  great eye and capture.</td>', 'Wow you are wayyy ahead of you age mate, very mature photographer,  great eye and capture.', '2014-10-17 09:53:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(7274625, 1131897, 27421, '<td valign="top">ewww deceiving... a setup candid .....:) LOL<br/> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Deve:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Tiny:</b></div><hr/><i> so this is a set up ? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Tiny yes mate it is, it is meant to show that this happens in real life, but it''s a bit insensitive to be right in there photographing someone being spoon fed while he has tears running down his face. Most of my work is very confronting,  my wife won''t let me put it up here on challenges,  because sometimes they are  bit too in your face type of photos. But that''s what interests me, issues we face in real life told through the photographers POV. </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'ewww deceiving... a setup candid .....:) LOL Originally posted by Deve: Originally posted by Tiny: so this is a set up ?   Tiny yes mate it is, it is meant to show that this happens in real life, but it''s a bit insensitive to be right in there photographing someone being spoon fed while he has tears running down his face. Most of my work is very confronting,  my wife won''t let me put it up here on challenges,  because sometimes they are  bit too in your face type of photos. But that''s what interests me, issues we face in real life told through the photographers POV. ', '2014-10-17 10:19:51.000000', NULL, 0),
