(7274712, 1132106, 124815, '<td valign="top">It was 7 from me. I am really curious about the look of the original . I guessed that it was your  shot and liked a lot the composition (not to mention the subject of the photo; can you really get this fish right off the boat?) but was in two minds about the processing. Could you show me the original please? I''d like to understand for myself since I have a lot of thoughts about the way I use the processing tools. <br/></td>', 'It was 7 from me. I am really curious about the look of the original . I guessed that it was your  shot and liked a lot the composition (not to mention the subject of the photo; can you really get this fish right off the boat?) but was in two minds about the processing. Could you show me the original please? I''d like to understand for myself since I have a lot of thoughts about the way I use the processing tools. ', '2014-10-17 15:08:33.000000', NULL, 0),
