(7274899, 1131737, 170281, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Pangurban:</b></div><hr/><i> I''m a little confused by the foot (?_ at the end of the seats. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I am not really sure how I captured this at all.  A person was walking in the frame from the left and his body showed up as a significant blur with his foot being significantly less so.  It is almost as though there is a bit of a blind spot with my camera/lens.  I am sure there is a logical explanation, but that is how the image came out.</td>', 'Originally posted by Pangurban: I''m a little confused by the foot (?_ at the end of the seats.   I am not really sure how I captured this at all.  A person was walking in the frame from the left and his body showed up as a significant blur with his foot being significantly less so.  It is almost as though there is a bit of a blind spot with my camera/lens.  I am sure there is a logical explanation, but that is how the image came out.', '2014-10-18 08:55:32.000000', NULL, 0),
