(7275119, 1132135, 46918, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club...<br/> <br/>Don, You got beat up on this image. The first thing that I thought was this pic is strait out of the 70''s (that would not hurt your score from me). I do like the foreground with the nice leaves. I also think that the light is too harsh on your model. The framing is good but I would love to know what she is holding. Overall I would say OK pic. I would have given it a 5.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club... Don, You got beat up on this image. The first thing that I thought was this pic is strait out of the 70''s (that would not hurt your score from me). I do like the foreground with the nice leaves. I also think that the light is too harsh on your model. The framing is good but I would love to know what she is holding. Overall I would say OK pic. I would have given it a 5.', '2014-10-18 23:24:51.000000', NULL, 0),
